elines Screenshot (1).png", "id": "3915626092078551", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499296127_3915626095411884_5364719753103044987_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Yc9pGUEibWAQ7kNvwEwTyaU&_nc_oc=AdrEiY-TJBbtZi7p-jjuypN6VWlXahiTFk_gxwuEKVdN4B-UFLPmWgOXNtM5w8cTlcY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHonjmU16Wi41Rd4MQKfUFeWS5tX9gVzuH4HfWQfeC77Q&oe=6A95D31A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Blade City Brand Assets Cover.png", "id": "1655153859945519", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310667_1655153863278852_7997685239185590787_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=se8PT6bo6L4Q7kNvwE1LbDr&_nc_oc=Adpw7XwLlM2R-olRNZxScAwnEFqO8eKxdHP9w1rxTJX5lMq9iqLNujCjRCCNiRlloFg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQH-0wHzWib0xbZQQZYyi_TIsJUFvUKTy2FjdxEhhVmcJg&oe=6A95D651"}, "display_name": "Blade City", "keywords": ["sports", "social", "sandbox", "platformer"], "long_description": "A rookie Ninja Monkey with a rusty blade, an empty wallet, and one impossible dream...to become the Master of the Blades \ud83e\udd77\n\nDodge & deflex \u2694\ufe0f in every match to win coins \ud83d\udcb0 \n\nSpend coins to upgrade blades, slay-high abilities, aura \u2728\n\nCoins also unlock mini-games across the city \ud83d\udd79\ufe0f\n\nSkate. Slice. Socialize \ud83d\udef9 \ud83c\udf54  \ud83c\udf63 \n\nGet rich\ud83d\udcb0. Get jacked \ud83d\udcaa. Throw rooftop parties \ud83c\udf89 . Flex \ud83e\udea9\n{1899581750729344}\n\n{2088024375447461}\n\nWanna help us build arena maps, blades, and expand this Ninja City? \ud83e\udd1d\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f\n\nJoin discord.gg/playbladecity\n\n{1714375429586515}", "short_description": "Become the ultimate Ninja Monkey in Blade City! \ud83e\udd77\ud83d\udc35\nYou have a blade. Everyone else has a blade. Good luck! \u2694\ufe0f"}]}, "developer_name": "Blade Lab", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://bladecityvr.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://bladecityvr.com/terms-of-service", "publisher_name": "Blade Lab", "support_website_url": "https://discord.gg/playbladecity", "website_url": "https://bladecityvr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "821934236779161"}, {"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "MULTI_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "1614607460665188"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2372246093265216"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2372246093265216"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1781905200, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2372246093265216"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1699376298854970", "version": "1.0.14"}, "id": "2403174663506544", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1614607450665189", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1699376298854970"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2403174663506544"}]}, "change_log": "v1.0.14 \u2014 Chopping Update\nNew Arena \u2014 Chopping\n\nSlice and chop your way to victory in a brand-new arena!\nCut off arms, heads, and more with your sword or axe.\nAvailable from your Watch \u2192 Arcade Mode \u2192 Chopping.\n\nWeekly Challenge \u2014 Intercept\n\nHit a ball that isn't targeting you \u2014 20 times this week.\n(Step into a hit meant for someone else.)\nReward: Redirect Orb\n\nCommunity Credit\nHuge shoutout to @The Roaring Knight, whose original suggestion inspired Redirect! Unlock it through this week\u2019s challenge!\n\n\nNew Blade \u2014 Razor Carver\n\nA fast, sharp blade for quick strikes.\nNow in the shop in 3 colors!\n\n\nNew Cosmetic Set \u2014 Cyber Ninja (White)\n\nSuit up in sleek white-and-blue armor, complete with a glowing red visor.\n\n\nAll-Time Quest Board\n\nCheck your Level progress any time on the new All-time Quest Board,\nright next to the Weekly Challenge board.\nSee how close you are to your next hat reward!\n\nImprovements\n\nReady Room\n\n* Just standing in the Ready Room doesn't queue you for a match anymore.\n* Use your Watch to turn the light green, to join the next match.\n\nDeath Physics\n\n* Defeated players now fall and tumble with fun new physics, while their outfits stay properly attached.\n* You'll now see who defeated you on the respawn screen.\n\nCrafting Table\n\n* New sparkly effects when you drop items or place orbs.\n* Your blade now flies back to your hand with a cool animation.\n\nFrogCam\n\n* Better camera position for third-person and portrait videos.", "created_date": 1787802834, "id": "1699376298854970", "version": "1.0.14", "version_code": 176, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1614607450665189", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1699376298854970"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1787771035, "id": "1699047608887839", "version": "1.0.14", "version_code": 175, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1614607450665189", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1699376298854970"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1787327760, "id": "1694016116057655", "version": "1.0.13", "version_code": 169, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1614607450665189", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1699376298854970"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2403174663506544"}]}, "change_log": " v1.0.13 \u2014 Shark Ball Update \nNew Arena \u2014 Shark Ball\n\nDive into an underwater battle where the ball has been replaced by a hungry shark!\nInstead of hitting a normal ball, you'll be sending a robotic shark chasing after your opponents.\nAvailable from your Watch \u2192 Classic Mode \u2192 Shark Ball.\n\nNew: Arena Map Voting\n\nYou can now vote for which Arena map to play!\nAfter voting for a game mode, keep an eye on your Watch. When you hear the notification sound, open it again to vote for the Arena map before the match begins.\nChoose your favorite battleground and jump in!\n\nWeekly Challenge \u2014 Final Blow\n\nLand the match-ending elimination 20 times this week.\n(Score the final elimination that wins the match.)\nReward: Crimson Pulse Edge\n\nNew Blade \u2014 Crimson Pulse Edge\n\nA sleek high-tech blade with a blazing crimson energy edge, built to stand out in every duel.\n\nNew Features\n\nFriend List\nAdd players you've met through your Watch, and quickly join them whenever they're online.\n\nUpdated Intro Screen\nThe intro experience has been refreshed.\n\nDeath Effects\nDefeating an opponent now has improved visual effects for a more satisfying finish.\n\nImprovements\n\nNighttime City\nBlade City now comes alive at night with a brand-new nighttime atmosphere.\n\nLIV Camera\n\n*  Smoother camera movement. \n*  Fixed avatar clipping and mirror issues. \n\nXP & Level Up Feedback\nImproved visual feedback to make XP gain and level ups more noticeable and rewarding.\n\nBalance Changes\n\nShockwave\nShockwave can no longer be used in the lobby.\n It still works normally inside Arena matches.", "created_date": 1787272290, "id": "1693415469451053", "version": "1.0.13a", "version_code": 166, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1614607450665189", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1699376298854970"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1787265131, "id": "1693355226123744", "version": "1.0.13a", "version_code": 165, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}